{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
They brought the ark up to the city
With shouting and the sound [Gm]of the horn
David danced before the [A]Lord
With all his might, with all his [Dm]might
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Dance, dance before the [Gm]Lord
[C]Leap for joy before the [F]Lord
[Bb]I will celebrate be[A]fore the Lord
I will dance before the [Dm]Lord
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Interlude}
| [Dm] | [Dm] | [Dm] | [Gm] |
| [Gm] | [A] | [A] | [Dm] |
| [Dm] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Michal watched him from the window
Saw the king leaping [Gm]in the street
I will be even more un[A]dignified
Than this for the [Dm]Lord
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
With all his might
{end_of_verse}

